18:["$","details",null,{"className":"mobile-contents","children":[["$","summary",null,{"children":"Contents · 12 Questions"}],["$","nav",null,{"aria-label":"移动端论文目录","children":[["$","a","problem",{"href":"#problem","children":["01"," ","Research Problem & Background"]}],["$","a","prior-work",{"href":"#prior-work","children":["02"," ","Prior Work & Research Gap"]}],["$","a","idea-reconstruction",{"href":"#idea-reconstruction","children":["03"," ","Idea Reconstruction"]}],["$","a","intuition",{"href":"#intuition","children":["04"," ","Core Intuition"]}],["$","a","method",{"href":"#method","children":["05"," ","Method & Worked Example"]}],["$","a","mathematics",{"href":"#mathematics","children":["06"," ","Mathematical Foundations"]}],["$","a","experiments",{"href":"#experiments","children":["07"," ","Experiments & Claims"]}],["$","a","takeaways",{"href":"#takeaways","children":["08"," ","Takeaways"]}],["$","a","assumptions",{"href":"#assumptions","children":["09"," ","Most Fragile Assumption"]}],["$","a","reproduction",{"href":"#reproduction","children":["10"," ","One-Week Reproduction"]}],["$","a","counterexample",{"href":"#counterexample","children":["11"," ","Counterexample Design"]}],["$","a","follow-up",{"href":"#follow-up","children":["12"," ","Follow-up Research"]}]]}]]}]
19:["$","div",null,{"className":"reading-sections","children":[["$","section","problem",{"id":"problem","children":["$undefined",["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"01"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Research Problem & Background"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"问题为什么重要，解决它有什么价值？"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-paper","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-paper","children":"Paper Claim"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"手写 prompt 容易受具体任务和设计者经验限制，固定的 prompt 改写 strategy 也可能阻碍 search。论文研究能否让 language model 进化任务 prompt，同时调整产生 prompt 变体的规则，使下一轮 search 采用由系统自己更新的改进 strategy。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: Promptbreeder: Self-Referential Self-Improvement Via Prompt Evolution · v1","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-inference","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-inference","children":"Inference"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"一个通用 Prompt 未必适合所有任务，人工找好 Prompt 又依赖大量试错。Promptbreeder 同时研究任务指令和生成指令变体的方法，希望搜索过程能形成更有效的 Mutation Prompt，而非一直依赖固定改写话术。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: Promptbreeder: Self-Referential Self-Improvement Via Prompt Evolution · v1","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}]]]}]]}],["$","section","prior-work",{"id":"prior-work","children":["$undefined",["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"02"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Prior Work & Research Gap"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"前人做到哪一步，缺口在哪里？"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-prior","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-prior","children":"Prior Work"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"OPRO 已将历史候选与分数放入 Meta-Prompt 生成新解。Promptbreeder 进一步区分 Task Prompt 与 Mutation Prompt，并对后者也进行变化。完整方法中的这种 Recursive Reuse 必须与只演化 Task Prompt 的 Variant 分开判断。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","2309.03409",{"href":"#reference-2309.03409","aria-label":"来源 2: Large Language Models as Optimizers","children":["[",2,"]"]}]]}]]}]]]}]]}],["$","section","idea-reconstruction",{"id":"idea-reconstruction","children":["$undefined",["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"03"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Idea Reconstruction"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"从已有知识与失败模式出发，如何走到这个想法？"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-inference","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-inference","children":"Inference"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"先从普通 Prompt Search 出发：所有候选都由同一改写指令产生，容易集中在相似措辞。改写指令本身也是文本，Model 同样能生成其变体。于是可以把“如何产生新 Prompt”纳入种群，让选择过程间接筛选有用的变异方式。这里的间接 Credit Assignment 是最需要警惕的地方。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","2309.03409",{"href":"#reference-2309.03409","aria-label":"来源 2: Large Language Models as Optimizers","children":["[",2,"]"]}]]}]]}]]]}]]}],["$","section","intuition",{"id":"intuition","children":[[["$","span","insight",{"className":"anchor-alias","id":"insight"}]],["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"04"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Core Intuition"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"用一个清楚的视角抓住方法本质。"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-inference","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-inference","children":"Inference"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"如果 mutation 规则也用自然语言表示，generator 就可以把自己的操作条件作为可编辑对象。由此可区分直接改进任务 prompt 和改进产生 prompt 的方法：后者会影响下一轮候选的分布，是本文自指机制的核心。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: Promptbreeder: Self-Referential Self-Improvement Via Prompt Evolution · v1","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}]]]}]]}],["$","section","method",{"id":"method","children":["$undefined",["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"05"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Method & Worked Example"}],"$L1e",["$L1f","$L20"]]}]]}],"$L21","$L22","$L23","$L24","$L25","$L26","$L27"]}]
