1f:["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-paper","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-paper","children":"Paper Claim"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"初始化多样化 prompt population，在训练题目上评估任务表现，以 tournament selection 保留更好的个体。language model 执行直接改写、分布式 mutation 等操作；hypermutation 会重写 mutation prompt，更新后的 mutation prompt 再参与后续任务 prompt 生成。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: Promptbreeder: Self-Referential Self-Improvement Via Prompt Evolution · v1","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}]
20:["$","div","1",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-inference","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-inference","children":"Inference"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"沿用原文算术任务作教学演示：Task Prompt 指导 Solver 解应用题，Mutation Prompt 要求改变解题组织方式。LLM 根据二者产生新 Task Prompt，在训练题上测 Fitness；Hyper-Mutation 还可改写 Mutation Prompt，新版本随后继续生成候选。输出是任务指令及伴随的变异策略。示例措辞为教学构造，实验还包含多种 Mutation Operators。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: Promptbreeder: Self-Referential Self-Improvement Via Prompt Evolution · v1","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}]
21:["$","section","mathematics",{"id":"mathematics","children":["$undefined",["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"06"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Mathematical Foundations"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"从符号、直觉与简单例子理解理论。"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-inference","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-inference","children":"Inference"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"两层字符串映射足以说明自指关系：P 是任务指令，M 是变异指令，H 是更外层变异指令。LLM(M+P) 生成 P′，LLM(H+M) 生成 M′。加号表示文本拼接。Fitness 评价的是后代任务表现，因此 M 的贡献与 P 的初始质量、采样运气混在一起；公式没有保证 M′ 比 M 更善于改进。"}],["$","pre",null,{"className":"math-block","aria-label":"数学表达式","children":"P′ = LLM(M + P)\nM′ = LLM(H + M)\nEvaluate task performance after applying P′"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: Promptbreeder: Self-Referential Self-Improvement Via Prompt Evolution · v1","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}]]]}]]}]
22:["$","section","experiments",{"id":"experiments","children":[[["$","span","results",{"className":"anchor-alias","id":"results"}],["$","span","observation",{"className":"anchor-alias","id":"observation"}]],["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"07"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Experiments & Claims"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"Research Question → Experiment → Answer"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-paper","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-paper","children":"Paper Claim"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Question：演化 Prompt 是否有效，变异策略的变化是否有贡献？→ Experiment：在算术、常识和分类任务比较提示基线与不同演化组件。→ Answer：作者报告任务增益；完整系统包含 Mutation Prompt 的更新与复用，但任务得分仍不足以单独识别每条 Mutation Strategy 的改进质量。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: Promptbreeder: Self-Referential Self-Improvement Via Prompt Evolution · v1","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-paper","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-paper","children":"Paper Claim"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"作者报告，进化出的 prompt 在算术与常识 reasoning benchmark 上超过所比较的人工 prompt strategy，并能产生适用于仇恨言论分类的复杂 prompt。实验验证了有限任务域中的 prompt evolution，不意味着 language model 底层参数或通用能力持续增加。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: Promptbreeder: Self-Referential Self-Improvement Via Prompt Evolution · v1","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}]]]}]]}]
23:["$","section","takeaways",{"id":"takeaways","children":["$undefined",["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"08"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Takeaways"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"这篇论文改变了哪些判断？"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-inference","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-inference","children":"Inference"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Prompt 可以承担 Solver 指令，也可以承担 Proposer 的改进策略。分类必须根据用途判断，不能因为实现载体同为文本，就把两种变化视为同一件事。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: Promptbreeder: Self-Referential Self-Improvement Via Prompt Evolution · v1","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}]]]}]]}]
24:["$","section","assumptions",{"id":"assumptions","children":[[["$","span","limits",{"className":"anchor-alias","id":"limits"}]],["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"09"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Most Fragile Assumption"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"哪一个假设失效会动摇方法？"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-inference","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-inference","children":"Inference"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"最脆弱的假设是好后代意味着好 Mutation Prompt。一个强父代或一次幸运采样可能让无效 Mutation Strategy 被保留。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: Promptbreeder: Self-Referential Self-Improvement Via Prompt Evolution · v1","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-inference","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-inference","children":"Inference"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"fitness 来自带答案的训练任务，base language model、外层选择算法和 hypermutation 机制仍固定。可编辑对象主要是 prompt 文本，结果受任务分布与评估预算制约；这里的 self-modification 范围不能延伸为完整系统任意重写和无界进步。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: Promptbreeder: Self-Referential Self-Improvement Via Prompt Evolution · v1","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}]]]}]]}]
25:["$","section","reproduction",{"id":"reproduction","children":["$undefined",["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"10"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"One-Week Reproduction"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"用一周检验一个最小且明确的命题。"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-hypothesis","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-hypothesis","children":"Hypothesis"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Day 1–2：固定十个初始 Task Prompts。Day 3–5：比较固定 Mutation 与可变 Mutation，在同样候选数下运行三轮。Day 6–7：将演化后的 Mutation Prompts 应用于全新的相同父代，测后继质量，隔离继承与变异贡献。"}],"$undefined",null]}]]]}]]}]
26:["$","section","counterexample",{"id":"counterexample","children":["$undefined",["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"11"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Counterexample Design"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"如何构造有辨识力的反例？"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-hypothesis","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-hypothesis","children":"Hypothesis"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"让一个 Mutation Prompt 几乎复制父代，另一个会有效修改弱父代。若前者恰好配到高分父代并获胜，随后应用到弱父代失效，就能直接暴露归因混淆。"}],"$undefined",null]}]]]}]]}]
27:["$","section","follow-up",{"id":"follow-up","children":[[["$","span","outlook",{"className":"anchor-alias","id":"outlook"}]],["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"12"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Follow-up Research"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"从缺陷与需求推导新的研究问题。"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-prior","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-prior","children":"Prior Work"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"后续相关工作 HyperAgents 已研究可编辑 Meta-Agent，并用受控的 Improvement@k 比较产生更好后继的能力。因此，仅增加 Improver 评测不足以支撑新颖性。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","2603.19461v1",{"href":"#reference-2603.19461v1","aria-label":"来源 3: HyperAgents","children":["[",3,"]"]}]]}]]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-hypothesis","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-hypothesis","children":"Hypothesis"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"研究 Mutation Strategy 的可识别评价：将父代难度和修改幅度作为干预变量，建立跨父代的策略作用图。相对 OPRO 的整体候选排名，这测量“何种策略在什么起点产生什么改进”。如果收益只能由父代分数解释，就应拒绝改进策略进化的强结论。 相对 HyperAgents，待检验的缺口是改进机制在何种条件下可分解、移植与继承；需要同起点、同预算的组件交叉实验，识别机制作用及交互项。这个缺口尚未完成穷尽式检索，不能宣称已确认 Novelty。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","2309.03409",{"href":"#reference-2309.03409","aria-label":"来源 2: Large Language Models as Optimizers","children":["[",2,"]"]}],["$","a","2603.19461v1",{"href":"#reference-2603.19461v1","aria-label":"来源 3: HyperAgents","children":["[",3,"]"]}]]}]]}]]]}]]}]
